From 43a8a0dbb5eb1170afd6ee12387289586e683ba7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: James Trotter <james@jamesat.dev>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 09:57:06 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] channels: account extbans (a:account), API channel access and
 sajoin

+b/+e/+I entries a:<account> match clients logged into that account
(EXTBAN=,am). POST /v1/channel_access syncs a channel's +i and the
account invite exceptions one creator manages; POST /v1/sajoin joins an
account's connected clients to channels. Lets an external role system
keep private channels and auto-join members without parsing IRC.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
